.TH "zoril\-stdlib" "7" "2026\-10\-27"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
zoril\-stdlib \- Overview of the Zoril standard library modules
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBimport\fR "<module>.\&zrl";
.br
\fBuse\fR <module>::{<item>, .\&.\&.\&};
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The Zoril standard library provides fundamental data structures, memory
management allocators, I/O streams, filesystem primitives, and process
execution facilities without depending on the legacy C standard library (\fBlibc\fR).\&
All operating system interactions are performed via direct kernel system calls.\&
.PP
.SH INSTALLATION AND DISCOVERY
.PP
Standard library modules are installed as source files (\fB.\&zrl\fR) into:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
$DATADIR/zoril/stdlib/ (default: /usr/local/share/zoril/stdlib/)
.fi
.RE
.PP
The compiler (\fBzoril\fR(1)) and driver (\fBzbuild\fR(1)) automatically locate the
standard library relative to their executable path (\fB.\&.\&/share/zoril/stdlib\fR).\&
Alternatively, the search location can be specified explicitly using the
\fB\-I\fR command\-line option.\&
.PP
.SH MODULE OVERVIEW
.PP
\fBzoril\-args\fR(3)
.RS 4
Command\-line argument inspection and iteration (\fBArgs\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-bufio\fR(3)
.RS 4
Buffered stream wrappers (\fBBufReader\fR, \fBBufWriter\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-bytevec\fR(3)
.RS 4
Internal bump\-backed byte vector buffers (\fBByteVec\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-clone\fR(3)
.RS 4
Explicit deep cloning traits and implementations (\fBClone\fR, \fBCopy\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-cmp\fR(3)
.RS 4
Equivalence relations and slice search helpers (\fBEq\fR, \fBcontains\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-core\fR(3)
.RS 4
Fundamental sum types (\fBOption\fR, \fBResult\fR) and standard traits.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-core0\fR(3)
.RS 4
Low\-level runtime panic, abort, trap, and byte swap primitives.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-file\fR(3)
.RS 4
File handle abstraction (\fBFile\fR), \fBOpenOptions\fR, and file read/write helpers.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-ffi\fR(3)
.RS 4
C type aliases (\fBc_int\fR, \fBc_long\fR, .\&.\&.\&) and \fBcstr_len\fR for calling C.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-fmt\fR(3)
.RS 4
Sink\-agnostic formatting for decimal integers and hexadecimal bytes.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-fsys\fR(3)
.RS 4
Filesystem operations (\fBlist_dir\fR, \fBmake_dir_all\fR, \fBacquire_file_lock\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-hash_impls\fR(3)
.RS 4
Primitive type implementations of the \fBHash\fR trait.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-hashmap\fR(3)
.RS 4
Open\-addressing hash table with linear probing (\fBHashMap\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-intern\fR(3)
.RS 4
Arena\-backed string deduplication and interning table (\fBInternTable\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-io\fR(3)
.RS 4
Direct kernel I/O, typed file descriptors (\fBFd\fR), and \fBRead\fR/\fBWrite\fR traits.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-iter\fR(3)
.RS 4
Functional iteration traits and combinators (\fBIterator\fR, \fBrange\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-local_mem\fR(3)
.RS 4
Internal test fixture for memory allocation failure validation.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-mem\fR(3)
.RS 4
Safe region\-based arena memory management (\fBArena\fR, \fBArenaMark\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-mem_raw\fR(3)
.RS 4
Low\-level raw memory mapping, bump primitives, and heap allocation.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-os_linux\fR(3)
.RS 4
Linux\-only interface: \fBO_\fR open flags and opening by raw flags.\& Imported as \fBos/linux.\&zrl\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-os_unix\fR(3)
.RS 4
POSIX\-only interface: file lock flags and \fBlseek\fR.\& Imported as \fBos/unix.\&zrl\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-proc\fR(3)
.RS 4
Subprocess spawning and execution management (\fBCommand\fR, \fBChild\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-sha256\fR(3)
.RS 4
Cryptographic SHA\-256 digest computation (\fBSha256\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-softfp\fR(3)
.RS 4
Software floating\-point arithmetic primitives.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-str\fR(3)
.RS 4
Validated UTF\-8 string slices and character validation (\fBStr\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-string\fR(3)
.RS 4
Growable byte strings (\fBString\fR) and inherent methods on \fB[u8]\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-sys\fR(3)
.RS 4
Low\-level kernel system calls and memory mapping wrappers.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-time\fR(3)
.RS 4
Monotonic clock and sleep (\fBmonotonic_ns\fR, \fBsleep_ns\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-unicode\fR(3)
.RS 4
Checked conversion from a Unicode scalar value to a \fBchar\fR (\fBchar_from_u32\fR).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBzoril\-vec\fR(3)
.RS 4
Growable generic arrays (\fBVec<T>\fR) with arena and allocator support.\&
.PP
.RE
